From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 03:14:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] media: apple: scaler: match the T8132 engine

The J604 (T8132, M4) runtime ADT describes /arm-io/scaler0 as
"scaler,t8101", hardware-version 0x14 (20), with four register windows
(0x505000000+0x38000, 0x505210000+0x4000, 0x505204000+0x4000,
0x504000000+0x8000), interrupts 1040 (MSR) and 1042 (PIODMA) and two
streams of dart-scaler. The driver programs hardware versions 10 to 22
through the same direct-register interface (its header comment and
apple-scaler-regs.h), and the only per-SoC data it keeps is the version
it logs and the number of register windows the binding describes.

Add the T8132 match with hardware version 20 and four windows. The first
window is 0x38000, above the driver's 0x28000 minimum.

Nothing matches until a board enables a node with this compatible.

Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5.5
---
 drivers/media/platform/apple/scaler/apple-scaler-drv.c | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/apple/scaler/apple-scaler-drv.c b/drivers/media/platform/apple/scaler/apple-scaler-drv.c
index 6a8d5f8438..eeab021803 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/apple/scaler/apple-scaler-drv.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/apple/scaler/apple-scaler-drv.c
@@ -814,6 +814,12 @@ static void asc_remove(struct platform_device *pdev)
 	video_unregister_device(&asc->vdev);
 }
 
+/* J604 runtime ADT /arm-io/scaler0: hardware-version 0x14. */
+static const struct apple_scaler_variant apple_scaler_t8132 = {
+	.hw_version = 20,
+	.num_reg = 4,
+};
+
 static const struct apple_scaler_variant apple_scaler_t6041 = {
 	.hw_version = 21,
 	.num_reg = 4,
@@ -825,6 +831,7 @@ static const struct apple_scaler_variant apple_scaler_t8140 = {
 };
 
 static const struct of_device_id asc_of_match[] = {
+	{ .compatible = "apple,t8132-scaler", .data = &apple_scaler_t8132 },
 	{ .compatible = "apple,t6041-scaler", .data = &apple_scaler_t6041 },
 	{ .compatible = "apple,t8140-scaler", .data = &apple_scaler_t8140 },
 	{ }
